#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/hpe_arubacx.rst:2
msgid "ArubaCX Network Integration"
msgstr "ArubaCX Network Integration"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/hpe_arubacx.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/hpe_arubacx.rst:6
msgid ""
"The ArubaCX network plugin is implemented as a |morpheus| "
"``GenericIntegrationProvider`` in Groovy. The plugin handles network and "
"cluster events generated by |morpheus| and modifies the configuration of "
"ArubaCX switches based on the cable connections between the affected "
"servers and switches. |morpheus| integrates directly with ArubaCX to "
"create or delete networks for OVS Port Groups that are added or deleted "
"within a configured Cluster."
msgstr ""
"The ArubaCX network plugin es implemented as un |morpheus| "
"``GenericIntegrationProvider`` in Groovy. The plugin handles network y "
"cluster eventos generated by |morpheus| y modifies el configuración of "
"ArubaCX switches basado en el cable connections entre el affected servers"
" y switches. |morpheus| integrates directly con ArubaCX to create o "
"delete networks para OVS Port Groups que son agregado o eliminado dentro "
"de un configurado Cluster."

